Mix components thoroughly and adjust pH to 6.0.  Autoclave under a N<sub>2</sub>-CO<sub>2</sub> (4:1, v/v) gas mixture.  After cooling, add the following solutions anaerobically and aseptically (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized and store under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 25 mM L-Cysteine&#183;HCI solution                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 130 mM FeCl<sub>2</sub> solution                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;10.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
