<I>Iron(III) citrate solution:</I> <br>
Mix 2.4 g iron(III) citrate and 90 ml distilled water, and boil until dissolved. Cool to an ambient temperature and adjust pH to 6.0 with 10 N NaOH solution. Fill up to 100 ml with distilled water.       <br>
